Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Keyboard remap, applied by the keyboard driver at boot:
;   1) Left Alt <-> Left Win   (full swap)
;
;
; NOTE: "Scancode Map" is a SINGLE value - every mapping must live in this
; one hex blob. Importing another .reg with a Scancode Map overwrites it.
;
; Requires a reboot. Undo with "KeyboardRemap_Restore.reg" + reboot.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Keyboard Layout]
"Scancode Map"=hex:00,00,00,00,00,00,00,00,03,00,00,00,38,00,5B,E0,5B,E0,38,00,00,00,00,00
